# attractor

--- Attractor_abi | attack | TID_ATTRACTOR_WEAPON_DESC
raw  Cosmo fires <!card.skill.projectile.component[0].values[0]> projectiles that orbit in a circle. The projectiles get further apart as they travel, while growing in size and damage.
now  Cosmo fires <!card.skill.projectile.component[0].values[0]> projectiles that orbit in a circle. The projectiles get further apart as they travel, while growing in size and damage.
  card.skill.projectile.component[0].values[0]  -  -> 3

--- Attractor_gadget_2 | gadget | TID_ATTRACTOR_GADGET_2_DESC
raw  Cosmo uses his telescope to reveal an area for <!card.accessory.skill.projectile.spawnareaeffectobject.timems.msasseconds>s sec, including invisible enemies. Enemy Brawlers inside this area cannot use movement abilities (dashes, jumps, teleports, etc.).
now  Cosmo uses his telescope to reveal an area for 6s sec, including invisible enemies. Enemy Brawlers inside this area cannot use movement abilities (dashes, jumps, teleports, etc.).
  card.accessory.skill.projectile.spawnareaeffectobject.timems.msasseconds  6  -> 6

--- Attractor_unique_1 | star power | TID_ATTRACTOR_SP_1_DESC
raw  Increases the orbit speed of Cosmo's main attack by <!card.character.component[0].trait[0].value>%.
now  Increases the orbit speed of Cosmo's main attack by 25%.
  card.character.component[0].trait[0].value  25  -> 25

--- Attractor_unique_2 | star power | TID_ATTRACTOR_SP_2_DESC
raw  Hitting an enemy with Cosmo's Super reloads <!card.value1> ammo.
now  Hitting an enemy with Cosmo's Super reloads 2 ammo.
  card.value1  2  -> 2
